  "description": "This package contains the Background Jobs module of the Endatix Platform. The BackgroundJobs table is the record of every job, and Quartz.NET, clustered in the same database, schedules and fires them. Persistence lives in its own \"jobs\" schema with its own migration history, so job migrations deploy independently of app-schema migrations. Quartz.NET is Apache-2.0 licensed; see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES in this package.\n\n      Endatix Platform is an open-source data collection and management library for .NET.",
